msgstr "The queue is the list of maps your character plays one after the other. Autopilot fills it from the song select: a playlist, the next songs, shuffle, or the same map on loop (or not at all, when disabled). You can reorder it, skip ahead or stop after the current map. Signed in, the queue is your character's: every device shows the same one, and your character keeps playing it for 12 hours after you close the game (24 with oss!supporter), ranked maps only. You can turn that off in the options."

